<p>ODS uses mobile-first breakpoints to adjust layout and content across different screen sizes.</p>
<table class="table table--compact"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Min. viewport width</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>xs (default)</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>sm</td><td>480px</td></tr><tr><td>md</td><td>768px</td></tr><tr><td>lg</td><td>992px</td></tr><tr><td>xl</td><td>1240px</td></tr><tr><td>xxl</td><td>1380px</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2 class="bold" id="scss-get-mixin"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="breakpoints#scss-get-mixin">SCSS <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">get()</span></span></code></span> mixin</a></h2>
